<item><title>Butembo civil society warns Ebola strike by care workers could hurt response</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/butembo-civil-society-warns-ebola-strike-by-care-workers-6729f0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/butembo-civil-society-warns-ebola-strike-by-care-workers-6729f0/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>Health workers in Butembo and Katwa are striking for two months of unpaid wages, a revised pay scale and better equipment.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:04:26 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/butembo-civil-society-warns-ebola-strike-by-care-workers-6729f0/share.jpg" length="42349" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/butembo-civil-society-warns-ebola-strike-by-care-workers-6729f0/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>DR Congo minister seeks genocide recognition in London</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-minister-seeks-genocide-recognition-in-london-c98251/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-minister-seeks-genocide-recognition-in-london-c98251/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>Human rights minister Samuel Mbemba urged UK institutions to sanction Paul Kagame and recognize Congolese genocides.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 05:43:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>MP Gratien Iracan warns DR Congo could lose control of Grand Inga project</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/mp-gratien-iracan-warns-dr-congo-could-lose-control-of-72957f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/mp-gratien-iracan-warns-dr-congo-could-lose-control-of-72957f/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>The National Assembly declared admissible on Wednesday, 11 November, a draft law that will govern how the Grand Inga hydropower project is carried out.</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:32:11 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>France welcomes UN sanctions listing of Kabila&apos;s FRN movement</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/france-welcomes-un-sanctions-listing-of-kabila-s-frn-5c5c7d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/france-welcomes-un-sanctions-listing-of-kabila-s-frn-5c5c7d/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>Paris reaffirms its support for DR Congo&apos;s sovereignty and territorial integrity in the east.</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:48:21 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>JB Mpiana returns to Paris&apos;s Accor Arena for 40-year career concert</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/jb-mpiana-returns-to-paris-s-accor-arena-for-40-year-career-008488/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/jb-mpiana-returns-to-paris-s-accor-arena-for-40-year-career-008488/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>Congolese music star Jean Bedel Mpiana Tshituka was scheduled to perform at the Accor Arena in Paris on Saturday, 14 November, marking 40 years in music.</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:54:14 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
